{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1138823-20th-martial-arts-help","id":1138823,"title":"20th-Martial Arts help","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-09T00:35:04-07:00","id":1138823,"title":"20th-Martial Arts help","content":"Hello! I've recently come to a impasse with two ST's I play with. I have a character in each game that utilizes martial arts, and so far its been just using melee with no finesse. The one character I have had the biggest issue practices Escrima/Kali and I was wondering if there was a solution to this other then how we've been treating it with brawl and melee when appropriate. With whats supposed to be a brutal martial art has been bogged down to 'one action I hit it with my baton, next action try and block, etc.' I've been hoping to make it flow easier.<br /> <br /> So how can I represent martial arts properly in the current edition? I remember faintly in previous editions there was a martial artist skill that acted as a rolled in lump of the brawl/melee.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T02:17:40-07:00","id":1138830,"title":"","content":"M20 has an entire section on martial arts maneuvers. It's a core ability that's similar to melee and brawl, but far more refined. While you have distinct weapons with special abilities in melee, you can use special attacks in brawl and martial arts that let you refine your fighting stile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T08:17:17-07:00","id":1138893,"title":"","content":"M20 is also kind of an odd game out in this respect, as the other games just use Brawl and Melee. Also, Martial Arts never acted as a lumped-in version of both Abilities; you had to have both Martial Arts and Melee if you wanted to use weapons, even for the Shih demon hunters, who had the most advantageous setup for Martial Arts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T12:54:01-07:00","id":1138969,"title":"","content":"Think my ST in the past used it wrong then. Where in M20 is the info on martial arts? Core book or how do you do that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-09T12:56:08-07:00","id":1138970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Freederp92</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1138823-20th-martial-arts-help?p=1138969#post1138969\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Think my ST in the past used it wrong then. Where in M20 is the info on martial arts? Core book or how do you do that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Core book. There may be some more options in the player's guide, but I've not seen it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-10T00:51:23-07:00","id":1139125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1138823-20th-martial-arts-help?p=1138893#post1138893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">M20 is also kind of an odd game out in this respect, as the other games just use Brawl and Melee. Also, Martial Arts never acted as a lumped-in version of both Abilities; you had to have both Martial Arts and Melee if you wanted to use weapons, even for the Shih demon hunters, who had the most advantageous setup for Martial Arts.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's kind of weird, that's right. But the rules are quite ok. Melee is all about using weapons (and weapons have a lot of different modificators in M20) while martial arts is about striking the opponent with very specific maneuvers. There are a lot of defensive abilities as well and a disarm mechanic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}